+/// 尽力把整串写进指定 fd；写短 / EIO 一律判失败，交给下一个通道（不静默吞掉半截还原串）。
+#[cfg(unix)]
+fn write_all_to_fd(fd: libc::c_int, bytes: &[u8]) -> bool {
+    let mut written = 0usize;
+    while written < bytes.len() {
+        let result = unsafe {
+            libc::write(
+                fd,
+                bytes[written..].as_ptr() as *const libc::c_void,
+                bytes.len() - written,
+            )
+        };
+        if result <= 0 {
+            return false;
+        }
+        written += result as usize;
+    }
+    true
+}
